  "description": "dotnet new templates for Lumeo Blazor projects. Includes a full Blazor WebAssembly app starter (lumeo-app) that boots styled and dark-mode-ready with zero setup, plus item templates for pages (lumeo-page), validated forms (lumeo-form, [LumeoForm] generator), and reusable components (lumeo-component). Templates follow current Lumeo conventions: the Class + AdditionalAttributes contract, the Form/FormField validation pattern, LumeoIcons + SvgGlyph, and theme tokens (no raw colors).",
